window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-020-4de223246a8bc003.json"]={sha256:"4de223246a8bc003331fe6e2f65b99d5887f7199bdfd2031743baceb07defb4d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-d78e76d901c6709c","url":"https://kernel.org/doc/html/latest/kernel-hacking/false-sharing.html","title":"False Sharing","titleEn":"False Sharing","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-020","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-020","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-021","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/networking/statistics.html"],"title":"Linux 網路計數器：回繞、重置與取樣時間","titleEn":"Linux network counters: wraparound, resets and sample duration","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付寫入 CSV、逐線擁有者表、縮小手算案例與真正共享的反例；程式只模擬軌跡；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the write CSV, per-line ownership ledger, small hand-calculated case and true-sharing counterexample. The exercise simulates traces locally and does not claim to measure hardware coherence traffic. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入 timestamp、counter、bits、epoch、wraps_known；輸出 delta、rate 與 validity，不把重啟樣本填成零。","differenceEn":"Input timestamp, counter, bits, epoch and wraps_known fields. Emit delta, rate and validity separately, preserving invalid intervals instead of replacing reset observations with misleading zero traffic.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["簡化模型中，同一線的連續寫入若換了核心便計一次擁有權轉移；初次取得不計，模型不含協定細節與寫入合併；八個核心輪流各寫一次，重複一千輪，共 8000 次；名義八計數器同線，變更每核心一條獨立線；名義式 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions；變更式 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","在確認恰好一次回繞的固定寬度模型中，差值為 modulus-old+new；速率再除以真實時間差；教學 16-bit 計數器由 65000 到 1000，epoch 相同且已確認一次回繞；時間差由 2 改為 4 秒；名義式 (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s；變更式 (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["In the simplified model, successive writes to the same line count one ownership transition when the writer core changes. Initial acquisition is excluded, as are coherence protocol details and write combining. Eight cores write in round-robin order for one thousand rounds, totaling 8000 writes. Initially all counters share one line; after padding, each core owns a separate line with the same update sequence. Nominal 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions; changed 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","With exactly one confirmed wrap in a fixed-width counter, delta is modulus minus old plus new. Divide by the actual elapsed duration; multiple wraps cannot be inferred from only two samples. A synthetic 16-bit byte counter moves from 65000 to 1000 in the same epoch, with one wrap explicitly confirmed. Elapsed time changes from 2 to 4 seconds; these are not Linux’s native counter-width claims. Nominal (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s; changed (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-030","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core/blob/master/infiniband-diags/man/perfquery.8.in.rst"],"title":"InfiniBand perfquery：四位元組單位與聚合邊界","titleEn":"InfiniBand perfquery: four-byte units and aggregation boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付寫入 CSV、逐線擁有者表、縮小手算案例與真正共享的反例；程式只模擬軌跡；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the write CSV, per-line ownership ledger, small hand-calculated case and true-sharing counterexample. The exercise simulates traces locally and does not claim to measure hardware coherence traffic. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立欄位字典，逐項列 raw_unit、multiplier、direction 與 scope；不依欄位名稱猜單位。","differenceEn":"Build a field dictionary specifying raw unit, multiplier, direction and scope. Require an explicit definition for each selected field instead of guessing units from a familiar-looking name.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["簡化模型中，同一線的連續寫入若換了核心便計一次擁有權轉移；初次取得不計，模型不含協定細節與寫入合併；八個核心輪流各寫一次，重複一千輪，共 8000 次；名義八計數器同線，變更每核心一條獨立線；名義式 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions；變更式 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","本課指定 PortXmitData 增量乘四得到位元組，再除時間與 1000000 得 decimal MB/s；不套用到所有計數器；單埠增量 1000000 counter units，觀測時間由 2 改為 4 秒；計數器未重置且觀察方向固定；名義式 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s；變更式 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["In the simplified model, successive writes to the same line count one ownership transition when the writer core changes. Initial acquisition is excluded, as are coherence protocol details and write combining. Eight cores write in round-robin order for one thousand rounds, totaling 8000 writes. Initially all counters share one line; after padding, each core owns a separate line with the same update sequence. Nominal 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions; changed 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For the specified PortXmitData counter, multiply increments by four, divide by elapsed seconds and then by one million for decimal MB/s. Do not apply that multiplier indiscriminately to every counter field. A single port increases by 1000000 counter units. Observation duration changes from 2 to 4 seconds, with no reset and unchanged transmit direction. This is a synthetic interval, not a fabric measurement. Nominal 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s; changed 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-067b923c66f4ac46","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/networking/statistics.html","title":"Interface statistics","titleEn":"Interface statistics","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-b7c409273267b461","url":"https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core/blob/master/infiniband-diags/man/perfquery.8.in.rst","title":"perfquery source and manual","titleEn":"perfquery source and manual","publisher":"linux-rdma project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
